abstract: "Code, recorded results and detector provenance of an applicability test that decides, at a stated error probability, whether a performance target met with an uncertainty threshold under one condition is applicable, not applicable or not determined under another, evaluated with PointPillars ensembles on KITTI and nuScenes."
